id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)\">\\(\\varphi_0(n),\\varphi_1(n)\\)</span> 属于下式所列公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)\">\\(X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_0)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_2(\\varphi_1)\\)</span>。数、集合参数均由 UC 关闭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Pi01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_0(n)\\land\\varphi_1(n))\\to\\exists X\\forall n[(\\varphi_0(n)\\to n\\in X)\\land(\\varphi_1(n)\\to n\\notin X)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Pi^0_1(S_2)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Pi01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{UC}(\\neg\\exists n(\\varphi_0(n)\\land\\varphi_1(n))\\to\\exists X\\forall n[(\\varphi_0(n)\\to n\\in X)\\land(\\varphi_1(n)\\to n\\notin X)]):\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1\\in\\Pi^0_1(S_2)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分离只决定两类上的成员条件，允许 X 在两类之外自由取值；它不要求存在任一类本身的理解集。Σ⁰₁ 与 Π⁰₁ 在这个原则中的强度不同，不能通过将“前缀类取补”误认为两者自动等价。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Exercise IV.4.8；纸面页 144；PDF 页 162。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"eaea482f0ad24c81","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ArithmeticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 